 the registry makes no clause-level claim about the 7 obligations it carries.\\\"\\n}\\n{\\n \\\"kind\\\": \\\"section_binding\\\",\\n \\\"keys\\\": [\\n  \\\"section:7.A\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"production\\\": {\\n  \\\"path\\\": \\\"internal/catalog/catalog.go\\\",\\n  \\\"declaration\\\": \\\"ForRelease\\\"\\n },\\n \\\"acceptance_cases\\\": [\\n  \\\"catalog-v050-exact\\\"\\n ],\\n \\\"coverage\\\": \\\"unevidenced\\\",\\n \\\"gap\\\": \\\"ForRelease only returns the reviewed typed catalog rows that reference 7.A; no clause of 7.A is enumerated against an acceptance case, so the registry makes no clause-level claim about the 2 obligations it carries.\\\"\\n}\\n===AC===\\n98\\nconfig-versioned-readers {'path': 'internal/config/loader.go', 'declaration': 'Load'}\\nconfig-durable-migration {'path': 'internal/config/migration.go', 'declaration': 'Migrate'}\\ncatalog-durable-recovery {'path': 'internal/catalog/catalog.go', 'declaration': 'Operation'}\\ncanonical-jcs-rfc8785 {'path': 'internal/canonicaljson/canonical.go', 'declaration': 'Canonicalize'}\\ncanonical-identity-refusal {'path': 'internal/canonicaljson/canonical.go', 'declaration': 'VerifyObjectIdentity'}\\ncore-record-identity-validation {'path': 'internal/canonicaljson/core_records.go', 'declaration': 'validateSessionEvent'}\\nscalar-platform-provider-validation {'path': 'internal/scalar/names.go', 'declaration': 'ParsePlatform'}\\nscalar-provider-id-validation {'path': 'internal/scalar/names.go', 'declaration': 'ParseProviderID'}\\nterminal-manifest-probe-admission {'path': 'internal/terminalbackend/manifest.go', 'declaration': 'AdmitProbe'}\\nterminal-manifest-identity-ownership {'path': 'internal/terminalbackend/manifest.go', 'declaration': 'ParseManifest'}\\nterminal-probe-identity-ownership {'path': 'internal/terminalbackend/manifest.go', 'declaration': 'ParseProbe'}\\nterminal-evidence-identity-ownership {'path': 'internal/terminalbackend/manifest.go', 'declaration': 'ParseEvidence'}\\nprovider-identity-ow