Count runes, not bytes; multibyte boundary fixtures at 256/257 |\\n| B3 | Blocking | `terminalbackend/manifest.go:273`, `provhost/protocol.go:262` | Reuse/copy `canonicaljson.validateSurrogateEscapes`; one `\\\\ud800` refusal fixture each |\\n| B4 | Blocking | `ownership.v0.5.0.json`, `traceability.go:43` | Register provider/provhost ownership, fix stale gap prose, re-pin hash; later add reverse scan |\\n| A1 | Advisory | `canonicaljson/closed_shapes.go:115-132` vs `manifest.go:515` | Decide the one identity owner for terminal schemas |\\n| A2 | Advisory | `provhost/identity.go:90` vs `core_records.go:207` | Delegate or agreement-test the duplicated §5.5 validator |\\n| A3 | Advisory | `provhost/protocol.go:30`, catalog v3 pins | Name the Provider Protocol 3.0.0 owner; record the bound |\\n| A4 | Advisory | `provider/provider.go:77-97` | Restructure provider errors for axerror composition (or document the lift contract) |\\n| A5-A9 | Advisory | see above | Cross-package equality test; shared AST-walker core; trust-asymmetry comment; merge logistics; nits |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 16062,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 4016,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
