g mismatches before launch or observation. The v3 transport envelope stays with provhost's v2 machinery, which speaks major 2 only and refuses recognizable 3.x as incompatible_protocol per the Section 7.A mismatch rule; decoding v3 failures under Structured Error 1.3.0 awaits the dual-stack host follow-up described in TASK-260906-vmzk0y's outcome. No clause of 7.A is enumerated against an acceptance case, so the registry makes no clause-level claim about the 2 obligations it carries.\"\n"}}}
